# Alpaca Paper Trading API Keys
# 1. Sign up at https://alpaca.markets
# 2. Switch to the Paper Trading environment (toggle in the top-left corner)
# 3. Go to Overview → API Keys → Generate New Key
# 4. Copy both keys below — these are for paper trading ONLY

ALPACA_API_KEY=PKTEST_your_paper_api_key_here
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=your_paper_secret_key_here
